	// the G43 a white-hot core in gold with notches running down it (it lingers: see the caller's life).
	// 2026-11-11 the new guns: 6 = the rivet gun's nail in flight (a short steel dash running down the path, a wisp of air behind it), 5 = the lever rifle's
	// white core in a copper edge, 4 = the Uzi's thin orange dashes
